---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import Closing from '../../components/Closing.astro';
import GuideCards from '../../components/GuideCards.astro';
import { gradeGuides, articles } from '../../data/guides.mjs';
import { site, link } from '../../config.mjs';
export function getStaticPaths() { return gradeGuides.map(guide => ({params:{band:guide.slug},props:{guide}})); }
const {guide} = Astro.props;
---
<Layout title={guide.title}><section class="page-hero wrap"><Breadcrumbs/><p class="eyebrow">ONE CHILD. THEIR NEXT STEP.</p><h1>{guide.title}</h1><p>{guide.intro}</p></section>
<div class="section wrap guide-layout"><article class="guide-prose"><section><h2>How one-on-one support helps</h2><p>{guide.approach}</p><div class="example-note"><p class="eyebrow">AN ILLUSTRATIVE LEARNING MOMENT</p><p>{guide.example}</p></div></section><section><h2>A focus for each class</h2><p>These are examples of the learning we can discuss, not a universal syllabus or a promise that every board introduces a topic in the same class. We confirm coverage from your child’s schoolwork.</p><div class="class-focus">{guide.classes.map(item => <section><p class="eyebrow">{item.name}</p><h3>{item.focus}</h3><p>{item.text}</p></section>)}</div></section><section id="subjects"><h2>What we teach</h2><dl class="subject-scope">{guide.subjects.map(([name, text]) => <div><dt>{name}</dt><dd>{text}</dd></div>)}</dl><p>Lessons are aligned to your child’s curriculum, including {site.curricula.join(', ')}. Share the current topics before assuming a particular subject or method is covered.</p><a class="text-link" href={link('subjects/')}>Read about all our subjects ↗</a></section><section><h2>A parent’s role in the plan</h2><p>{guide.parent}</p><p>The first conversation covers your child’s class, needs and preferred times. A mentor match, demo details and class arrangements are confirmed together. <a href={link('how-it-works/')}>See the steps from enquiry to regular lessons</a>.</p></section></article><aside class="guide-sidebar"><p class="eyebrow">MAKE IT PERSONAL</p><h2>Bring the schoolwork.<br/>Bring the questions.</h2><p>Tell us which topic feels difficult and what your child has already tried.</p><Button/><p class="small-note">Message us for a personalized plan.</p><nav aria-label="Other learning stages">{gradeGuides.filter(item => item.slug !== guide.slug).map(item => <a href={link(`programs/${item.slug}/`)}>{item.title}</a>)}<a href={link('nri-families/')}>Support for NRI families</a></nav></aside></div>
<section class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">FOR THE PARENT BEHIND THE LEARNER</p><h2>Practical ideas for home.</h2><GuideCards items={articles.filter(article => guide.related.includes(article.slug)).map(article => ({title:article.title,description:article.description,path:`learn/${article.slug}/`}))}/></section><Closing/></Layout>
